+            "\n锛堟ā鍨嬩笉鍙敤锛屼互涓婁负璁粌闆嗗潎鍊间及绠楋級"
+            if exec_result["status"] == "fallback" else ""
+        )
+
+        return MockDataLoader.mark_simulated({
+            "answer": (
+                f"鍩轰簬 ML 棰勬祴鐨勭患鍚堣偉鍔涜瘖鏂細\n"
+                f"- SOC锛堝湡澹ゆ湁鏈虹⒊锛夛細{pred['soc_prediction']:.2f} g/kg锛堢疆淇″害 {pred['soc_confidence']:.0%}锛塡n"
+                f"- Dose锛堟柦鑲ラ噺锛夛細{pred['dose_prediction']:.2f} t/ha锛堢疆淇″害 {pred['dose_confidence']:.0%}锛寋pred['dose_warning']}锛?
+                f"{imputation_note}{fallback_note}"
+            ),
